lesson: 224
title: Years, decades and seasons
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: A year has 12 months, 4 seasons of 3 months each, and 52 weeks and a day or two; a decade is 10 years and a century 100 years.
explain: To turn years and months into months, take 12 months for every year and add the extra months.
explain: A child of 7 years and 5 months: 7 × 12 = 84, and 84 + 5 = 89 months.
vars: a=name y=2..9 m=2..11
answer: y * 12 + m
exercise: {a} is {y} years and {m} months old. How many months old is {a.he}?
exercise: A tree was planted {y} years and {m} months ago. How many months ago was it planted?
exercise: {a} has lived in this town for {y} years and {m} months. How many months is that?
exercise: A car is {y} years and {m} months old. How many months old is the car?
exercise: {a} has been learning the piano for {y} years and {m} months. For how many months has {a.he} been learning?
exercise: my little bro is {y} n {m} months, how many months is that
exercise: we moved here {y} years and, um, {m} months ago. months?
exercise: {a}'s {y+1}, no sorry {y}, and {m} months. how old in months
exercise: had my dog {y} yrs {m} months, he's ace. how many months is that
exercise: nan says shes been knitting this blanket {y} years {m} months lol. in months?
exercise: How many months are there in {y} years and {m} months?
test: Give {a}'s age in months if {a.he} is {y} years {m} months old.
test: Counting only months, how long ago did a school open {y} years and {m} months ago?
test: The museum's clock has run for {y} years and {m} months without stopping. For how many months is that?
test: {a} reckons {y} yrs {m} months is {y*10+m} months. wrong? whats right
test: how many months in {y} years n {m} months
test: {a} is {y} and {m} months, and {a.his} sister's {y+3}. how many months old is {a}
exam: Determine the age, expressed in months, of a child whose age is stated to be {y.words} years and {m.words} months.
exam: It is given that a tenancy has subsisted for a period of {y} years and {m} months. Ascertain the duration of the tenancy in months.
exam: State the number of calendar months comprised in an interval of {y} years and {m} months.
exam: An apparatus has been in continuous service for {y} years and {m} months. Compute the period of service in months.
exercise: Grandad passed on when {a} was {y} years and {m} months old. How old was {a} then, in months?
exercise: my bro's been "finding himself" for {y} years n {m} months, on the sofa, lazy git. how many months is that
test: The old dog was "put to sleep" at the age of {y} years and {m} months. For how many months did he live?
